{"reviewId": "254854030_85NCgfvvt", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "繁荣期大宗商品全面牛市，黄金的 “抗通胀、负利率” 属性被弱化，其商品属性与风险偏好驱动占主导。\n经济高速增长，企业盈利强劲，市场风险偏好极高，资金涌入股票、大宗商品等风险资产。此时即使实际利率走低，资金也不会优先选择黄金（无息资产），而是流向能带来更高收益的原油、工业金属等大宗商品；甚至若经济过热引发实际利率小幅上升，大宗商品的需求仍能支撑其价格，黄金也可能因通胀预期同步上涨，导致与实际利率的负相关关系失效。\n繁荣期黄金的商品属性（工业需求）和通胀对冲属性虽存在，但被风险资产的赚钱效应覆盖，资金分流使得其与实际利率的传统负相关关系不再显著，甚至因共同的通胀驱动出现同向波动。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "但在繁荣期，这种关系基本上不存在，甚至相反，这实际上是康波中不同阶段大宗商品的表现不同所致。", "range": "25386-25432", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "254854030_85NCgfvvt", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1767147183, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 396380858, "name": "YY", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/RpAicsb4DNeuZKLTuOm9STAzMyKgFVOKKOicHOA5cpicuUoLKeHuEg2MKUz5MQquRKzicxicibROf9SAcutMibH2lpMQ9ic8swCssG1SxYy3pCyEtbI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "YY", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-10